  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.15 Hearth system installation and service technician",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.15 “Hearth system installation and service technician” means “hearth system installation and service technician” as defined in RSA 153:27, IX, namely “any person engaged in the installation, servicing, and repair of liquefied propane or natural gas hearth appliances and venting systems.”\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.10) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec100.html"
